o the stadium. In a frantic final ten minutes, Brentford looked to catch Reading on the break, with Igor Thiago forcing two world-class saves from Joel Pereira . Despite a late flurry of substitutions and tactical shifts from both managers—including the introduction of Aaron Hickey for the visitors and George Earthy for the hosts— Brentford held firm to secure a 2-1 victory and their place in the next round."
